            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo Dawidi anesha Abafilisitiya, abamara igabo, atsinda igisagara cabo gikuru, arakibanyaga.",
