            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ashira amaboma mu gihugu c’Abanyedomu, ayakwiragiza muri Edomu hose. Abanyedomu bose baca baba abatwarwa ba Dawidi. Nuk’ Uhoraho yahora aha Dawidi intsinzi aho yaja hose.",
          "type": "text",
